      "EpisodeMasterId": 2003107,
      "Order": 2,
      "GroupOrder": 12,
      "SpeakerName": "静香",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "　然后……我遇见了那个孩子）",
      "VoiceFileName": "20031070111",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 502,
          "HeadDirectionMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "102"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2003107014,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2003107,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 13,
      "SpeakerName": "静香",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "（小时候那段无忧无虑的时光，温暖又温柔，像宝物一样。/n　在那道防波堤上，我知道了表演的喜悦）",
      "VoiceFileName": "20031070120",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 202,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 9,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "102"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2003107015,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2003107,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 14,
      "SpeakerName": "知冴",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "……笑得好幸福。/n看动作，是在演什么吗？",
      "VoiceFileName": "20031070130",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 102,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 11,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 10603,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "106"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2003107016,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2003107,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 15,
      "SpeakerName": "卡特莉娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "她像是在看着某个人，笑得很开心。/n那……是和心菜的回忆……之类的？",
      "VoiceFileName": "20031070140",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 2,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        },
        {
          "slotNumber": 2,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 111,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 7,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 10303,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 4,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "103"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2003107017,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2003107,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 16,
      "SpeakerName": "静香",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "（可是，那样的时光没能持续太久。我们分别了，/n　我唯一的挚友忘记了我——）",
      "BackgroundCharacterImageFileName": "140800_0",
      "VoiceFileName": "20031070150",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "102"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2003107018,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2003107,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 17,
      "SpeakerName": "静香",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "（再次醒来时，我终于明白自己究竟是什么。）",
      "BackgroundCharacterImageFileName": "140800_0",
      "VoiceFileName": "20031070160",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "102"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2003107019,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2003107,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 18,
      "SpeakerName": "静香",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "（下雨天的公园里，我想替那个孩子擦去眼泪。/n　隔着水中的倒影伸出手——却怎么也够不到）",
      "BackgroundCharacterImageFileName": "140800_0",
      "VoiceFileName": "20031070170",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "102"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2003107020,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2003107,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 19,
      "SpeakerName": "静香",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "（我，孤身一人。）",
      "BackgroundCharacterImageFileName": "140800_0",
      "VoiceFileName": "20031070180",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "102"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2003107021,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2003107,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 20,
      "SpeakerName": "卡特莉娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "（做完镜像哑剧之后，她无力地倒在地上——/n　这是在表现和心菜分开时的悲伤吗？）",
      "VoiceFileName": "20031070190",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 111,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 11,
          "SpineId": 10303,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "103"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2003107022,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2003107,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 21,
      "SpeakerName": "卡特莉娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "（……明明一句台词都没有。/n　这是什么样的表现力……）",
      "VoiceFileName": "20031070200",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 509,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 5,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
